<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">
  <PropertyGroup>
    <OutputType>Exe</OutputType>
    <TargetFramework>net8.0</TargetFramework>
    <RollForward>LatestMajor</RollForward>
    <ImplicitUsings>enable</ImplicitUsings>
    <Nullable>enable</Nullable>
    <LangVersion>latest</LangVersion>

    <!-- Package metadata -->
    <Version>1.6.4</Version>
    <Authors>Peter Zalutski</Authors>
    <Copyright>Copyright (c) 2025 Peter Zalutski</Copyright>
    <Description>MCP server providing 92 AI-optimized tools for .NET/C# semantic code analysis using Roslyn.</Description>
    <PackageLicenseExpression>MIT</PackageLicenseExpression>
    <PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/pzalutski-pixel/sharplens-mcp</PackageProjectUrl>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/pzalutski-pixel/sharplens-mcp</RepositoryUrl>
    <PackageTags>mcp;roslyn;csharp;dotnet;code-analysis;ai;semantic-analysis</PackageTags>
    <PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>
v1.6.4
Added:
- Multi-targeted projects are one project: results reported once with targetFrameworks; projectName accepts the plain or the framework-qualified name.
- find_tests kind and dispatchOnlyTests; find_untested_code entryPointCounts and dispatch-only labelling; notice on by-name tools when a type name shadows a framework type; kind and viaDispatch on call edges; loadWarnings and lastLoadFailure; .slnf solutions; MCP ping; STALE_DOCUMENT instead of overwriting a file changed on disk, UNSUPPORTED_ENCODING instead of writing a file its encoding cannot reproduce.
Changed:
- One call model behind every call tool and the coverage tools, following extension calls, constructors, accessors, operators, partial implementations and receiver-aware dispatch.
- Test entry points detected per framework (xUnit v2/v3, NUnit, MSTest, TUnit, Reqnroll, SpecFlow) including setup, constructors, fixtures and step bindings.
- Type names resolve in every documented spelling; partial names return suggestions; overloadIndex means the same overload everywhere.
- Deterministic result order; validated limits and enumerated parameters; package and project facts from MSBuild evaluation; naming checks match IDE1006.
Fixed:
- Cross-project tests missed when package versions or target frameworks differ; find_tests re-analyzing shared code per test.
- Apply and sync overwriting other files, changing encodings or line endings, and editing project files.
- Edit tools producing code that does not compile or changes meaning (change_signature, rename conflicts, extract_method, code generation, move/split/remove, usings, code actions, fix_all).
- load_solution false partial loads, unrestored projects reported as clean, failed loads, blocked initialize, non-ASCII input; backslash paths on Linux and macOS; analysis-tool defects across diagnostics, code fixes, metrics, stack traces, searches, hierarchies and documentation.
Full history: CHANGELOG.md in the repository.
    </PackageReleaseNotes>

    <!-- .NET Tool packaging -->
    <PackAsTool>true</PackAsTool>
    <ToolCommandName>sharplens</ToolCommandName>

    <!-- Source Link and deterministic builds for supply chain trust -->
    <PublishRepositoryUrl>true</PublishRepositoryUrl>
    <EmbedUntrackedSources>true</EmbedUntrackedSources>
    <IncludeSymbols>true</IncludeSymbols>
    <SymbolPackageFormat>snupkg</SymbolPackageFormat>
    <Deterministic>true</Deterministic>
    <ContinuousIntegrationBuild Condition="'$(GITHUB_ACTIONS)' == 'true'">true</ContinuousIntegrationBuild>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <InternalsVisibleTo Include="SharpLensMcp.Tests" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Build.Framework" Version="17.11.48" ExcludeAssets="runtime" PrivateAssets="all" />
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Build" Version="17.11.48" ExcludeAssets="runtime" PrivateAssets="all" />
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.CodeAnalysis.Workspaces.MSBuild" Version="5.3.0" />
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.CodeAnalysis.CSharp.Workspaces" Version="5.3.0" />
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.CodeAnalysis.Features" Version="5.3.0" />
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.CodeAnalysis.CSharp.Features" Version="5.3.0" />
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Build.Locator" Version="1.11.2" />
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.SourceLink.GitHub" Version="8.0.0" PrivateAssets="All" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <None Include="../README.md" Pack="true" PackagePath="/" />
  </ItemGroup>
</Project>
